& [Review]
  + request parsing is bounded before decode and accepts one strict outer value only
  + dispatch calls only the published effect-free semantic inspection API and retains its exact result or fault classification
  + success and refusal are structurally exclusive response coordinates are fixed and replay compares the complete deterministic value
  + bounded fault shaping preserves valid codes truncates UTF-8 only at character boundaries and never adds request source content to diagnostics
  + component dependencies and source contain no ambient I/O storage network process provider model clock random or unsafe route

& [AdversarialClosure]
  + unknown duplicate malformed trailing unsupported and oversized requests refuse as sealed responses
  + invalid nested digest yields one refused envelope with no partial result
  + response result-fault coexistence omission substitution request mismatch and digest tampering refuse
  + exact-bound and over-bound raw forms are covered without broadening authority

& [WorkspaceClosure]
  + focused debug and overflow-release each pass76
